            "subfield": {
              "code": "a",
              "content": "Commercial map of New South Wales featuring post offices, receiving offices, calling places, telegraph and telephone offices, telephone exchanges, mail routes. Municipalities have been tinted dark green with shires coloured variously. The second sheet accompanying the map is an alphabetical Index to Places and also includes a table of Area, Population and Dwellings of Shires and Municipalties as at 31 Dec 1925."
